FactoryWorks is licensed per file (ADR-0102):

- Code is LGPL-3.0-only (LICENSES/LGPL-3.0-only.txt): the scripts and the workflows.
- The suite's own prose is CC BY 4.0 (LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt): docs, the glossary and the ADRs.
- The vendored agent skills keep the licence they came with (LICENSES/MIT.txt).

REUSE.toml says which licence covers which file.
